0..77 Comment "//! `tree-state-wp` gives a state weakest-precondition observation over data."
78..81 Comment "//!"
82..255 Comment "//! It represents increment as a tree in the state row. It folds the tree into a type. The normaliser computes a program\'s precondition. The kernel replays each declaration."
256..259 Comment "//!"
260..547 Comment "//! A Dijkstra monad pairs a program with evidence below a specification. `incrSpecified` gives evidence at `isOne`. `incrSpecifiedEverywhere` gives evidence at every postcondition. `incrSpecBare` keeps the unpaired evidence. `doneSpecified` gives return evidence at every postcondition."
548..551 Comment "//!"
552..614 Comment "//! - see: #2773 — `incrSpecifiedEverywhere`, `incrSpecBare`"
615..651 Comment "//! - see: #2751 — `doneSpecified`"
652..700 Comment "//! - cites: [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]"
701..816 Comment "//! [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3341708 \"Maillard et al., Dijkstra Monads for All\""
818..863 Comment "// The import gives Either, StateOp and Prog."
864..870 Keyword "import"
871..872 StringLit "\""
872..893 StringLit "../effects/tree.gandr"
893..894 StringLit "\""
894..895 Other ";"
